                  <profiles>
                    <profile name="Turned Loyalist Dread" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="0430-10c2-d697-25b4">
                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Roll a D6 and consult the chart below for one of the effects.


1: Bullwark, Model may re-roll Failed saving throws
2: Tactical Targeting, Model gains +1 to hit rolls when targeting a model already shot at by a friendly unit
3: Putrid Flames, Increase the AP of all attacks by +1
4: Ferial Hunger, this model increase its WS in a turn in which it charged.
5: Forges Herald, This models Toughness is Increases by +1
6: Decapatating strike, This model gains the Precision Special rule.</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
